<title>SLOVENIA: Etol to increase number of listed shares.</title>
<headline>Etol to increase number of listed shares.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovenian aromatic oils maker Etol will list 72,144 additional shares on the main market of the Ljubljana stock exchange, taking the number of its listed shares to 264,771, the bourse said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The new shares will be listed on Wednesday. After the listing Etol's shares will represent 91.8 percent of the company's equity.</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
